# Reorder every checklist item of an owned task

Local implementation verified at 0.3.0-dev.9. Deployment is unverified; set base_url (including /api/v1) only after checking the target release. No agent-runtime endpoints are included.

Current OPEN owner, project membership and checklist management permission. Submit every current item exactly once. Preserves IDs, titles, assignees, deadlines and completion. Shared human revision and durable audit/retry contract; archived or deleting projects reject new writes.

Authorization uses current effective permission keys plus resource scope and lifecycle checks. Role labels do not replace these checks.

